{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>訪談節目《九運會客室2》自10月中開播以來爭議不斷，男主持李凱賢Brian在第13集訪問資深女星夏文汐時因事前 …</p><p></p>\n<p>訪談節目《九運會客室2》自10月中開播以來爭議不斷，男主持李凱賢Brian在第13集訪問資深女星夏文汐時因事前毫無準備而引發討論。面對主持對自己參演過經典作品及熱播劇集一無所知，向來優雅從容夏文汐當場直斥對方表現不合格。</p>\n<h2>夏文汐受訪遭主持Brian零準備對待</h2>\n<p>節目邀請到80年代性感女神夏文汐擔任嘉賓，她在席間大方分享昔日與周潤發及張國榮等巨星合作經歷。身為主持之一李凱賢卻在鏡頭前坦言，在眾多影視作品中僅看過對方參演過電影《寒戰1994》，對其餘代表作近乎一無所知。面對主持事前零功課態度，一向好脾氣夏文汐亦難掩無奈，當場指出他準備不足及直斥「唔掂」。她更忍不住開口勸導對方：「咁失敗㗎！呢套你又冇聽過，冇睇過？咁你要睇返。」</p>\n<h2>Brian狂爆粗 被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏</h2>\n<p>Brian在鏡頭前不時露出誇張表情，全程猶如「坐觀眾席」般只懂搭嘴「That’s fucking right!」、「Amazing!」、「Wow it’s crazy」等簡單英文及粗口，被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏。有眼利網民更留言指出，夏文汐在席間似乎刻意避開與Brian交談，對其粗俗言行有所保留。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974157176221_4842705376af680dde4927.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619678.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974157176221_4842705376af680dde4927.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian狂爆粗 被指嚴重破壞訪談節奏（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974298753273_14130521366af680df5e1de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619672.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974298753273_14130521366af680df5e1de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>一向好脾氣夏文汐亦難掩無奈，當場指出他準備不足及直斥「唔掂」。（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974440159992_18698383226af680e0efa80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619675.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974440159992_18698383226af680e0efa80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>全程猶如「坐觀眾席」般只懂搭嘴「That’s fucking right!」、「Amazing!」、「Wow it’s crazy」等簡單英文及粗口（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>伍詠薇獨力撐大局 夏文汐優雅狀態成強烈對比</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，兩位主持與嘉賓的表現成為網民熱議焦點。不少觀眾大讚年屆六旬的夏文汐保養得宜、舉止優雅大方，面對後輩的無知仍保持風度，狀態大勇；而拍檔伍詠薇亦盛裝打扮以示尊重，憑藉豐富的主持經驗與夏文汐對答如流，被讚「憑一人之力撐起整個節目」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974618766913_2837335636af680e2ad4ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619676.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974618766913_2837335636af680e2ad4ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>夏文汐優雅狀態（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397479722622_18512014486af680e46a9d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619673.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397479722622_18512014486af680e46a9d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：youtube@HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民洗版促製作組換走男主持</h2>\n<p>隨著這集未經刪剪原片在YouTube直出，社交平台Threads及YouTube隨即湧現大量負評，大批網民一面倒批評男主持市井及無做功課。有網民發文質疑電視台會否聽取民意將他撤換，留言直指他「為爆粗而爆粗，拉低成個節目格調」，更有人直言「伍姑娘完全一個人做都可以，直接剪走男主持」。雖然有少數人表示喜歡他講粗口夠搞笑，但主流意見仍促請製作團隊正視觀眾訴求。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974997156802_17606328336af680e666589.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619666.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453974997156802_17606328336af680e666589.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397530766706_7152759586af680e983c30.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619669.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17945397530766706_7152759586af680e983c30.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453975417082371_8235845316af680eaa7e80.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6319028075592619667 (1).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453975417082371_8235845316af680eaa7e80.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：c）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b9%9d%e9%81%8b%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%a2%e5%ae%a42/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九運會客室2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%8f%e6%96%87%e6%b1%90/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">夏文汐</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e5%87%b1%e8%b3%a2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李凱賢</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541578\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:35:43.660129+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1457,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:16:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:30.622082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:16.860443+00:00","content_hash":"97b2e385d3efd13357325441c1004402b3a0baf75d5163721ce5cac8f22849a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}